# Data Integrity Audit Command

When the user says **"run data integrity audit"** or **"data integrity audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/data-integrity-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/data-integrity/YYYY-MM-DD-data-integrity-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/data-integrity-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/data-integrity/`
